      "title": "模型设置 / Model setup",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 模型文件 / Model files\n\n放进 `ComfyUI/models/LLM/Qwen3.8/`：\n- `Qwen3.8-27B-UD-Q4_K_M.gguf`\n- `mmproj-BF16.gguf`\n\n这是示例使用的 Unsloth 文件。用其他版本时，在加载器里换成配套的主模型和投影。模型会在首次对话时加载。\n\nPlace the Unsloth pair above in the model folder, then select both files in the loader. If you use another release, select its matching model and projector. Weights load on the first chat.\n"
      ],
